    <mxCell id="title_banner" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 18px; color: #3A2010;&quot;&gt;ERD LOGIC — FLASH SALE TICKET HYBRID (BARKER NOTATION)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px; color: #555555;&quot;&gt;Khung chia PK / Thuộc tính | Nét Liền = Must | Nét Đứt = May | Crowfoot = Many | Bar = One | Phụ thuộc định danh [UID]&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=1;fillColor=#F5EBE6;strokeColor=#6B4423;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="60" y="15" width="1290" height="50" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="legend_box" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 12px; color: #6B4423;&quot;&gt;QUY CHUẨN BARKER NOTATION&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;border: 0.5px solid #6B4423;&quot;&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;1. Ngăn cách thuộc tính:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Khung trên:&lt;/b&gt; # UID (Primary Key)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Khung dưới:&lt;/b&gt; * Bắt buộc &amp; o Tùy chọn&lt;br&gt;• &lt;i&gt;Không ghi FK thô trong bảng&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. Nét vẽ quan hệ:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Nét Liền (Solid):&lt;/b&gt; MUST (bắt buộc)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Nét Đứt (Dashed):&lt;/b&gt; MAY (tùy chọn)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Nửa đứt — Nửa liền:&lt;/b&gt; Phía May đứt, Phía Must liền&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Đầu Crowfoot:&lt;/b&gt; Nhiều (Many)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Đầu Bar (|):&lt;/b&gt; Một (One)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[UID]:&lt;/b&gt; Thực thể con phụ thuộc định danh&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;startSize=28;fontStyle=1;align=center;fillColor=#FFFBF0;strokeColor=#6B4423;strokeWidth=1.5;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
